      "review_summary": "The PR wraps the two path-based proxy capture session/event DELETE statements in `runSqliteImmediateTransactionSync` in `src/proxy-capture/store.sqlite.ts`.\n\nPR surface: Source +4. Total +4 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. for source-level reproduction: current main still shows the two path-based DELETE statements outside `runSqliteImmediateTransactionSync`. I did not simulate a crash between the statements in this read-only review.",
